<title>USA: Analysis &amp; Technology forms new unit.</title>
<headline>Analysis &amp; Technology forms new unit.</headline>
<dateline>NORTH STONINGTON, Conn. 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Analysis &amp; Technology Inc said Tuesday it has formed a new subsidiary, Interactive Media Corp, consolidating several units.</p>
<p>The company said Interactive Media is already a key element of its growth strategy. Commercial revenues in its Interactive Media unit grew 28 percent last year to $10 million.</p>
